<title>USA: Inacom acquires Corporate Resources Intl.</title>
<headline>Inacom acquires Corporate Resources Intl.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inacom Corp said Tuesday it acquired Bingham Farms, Mich.-based  Corporate Resources International Inc, a provider of fixed-asset inventory and reconciliation services.</p>
<p>Included in the acquisition is Corporate Resources' affiliate, Motor City Computer Services, Pontiac, Mich., which provides technology asset security, retirement and refurbishment services.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Inacom is a technology management services company.</p>
<p>	     ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
